                                "sense_id": "05e94415-58e6-377f-a045-d50a3801a74b",
                                "text": "[…] adelopods, such as clams, quahaugs, and shell-skids."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "71efba5d-2e30-43c8-bd32-a5f5c0aa4e84",
                                "sense_id": "05e94415-58e6-377f-a045-d50a3801a74b",
                                "text": "Maiden, gliding o'er the sod, / As by the Graces' sandal shod, / Art thou an adelopod?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "927db9ff-185d-42c3-b654-0dbd04e5d104",
                                "sense_id": "05e94415-58e6-377f-a045-d50a3801a74b",
                                "text": "The adelopod, we should think, might walk upon the cream of time without disturbing it"
                            }
